:: spin-the-bottle -> @exit
  @place-key high_school
  @pool school.traversal
  @chance 0.05
  @when school.phase == "lunch"
  @when not daily.played_spin_the_bottle

  @onenter
    @effect set daily.played_spin_the_bottle
  @endonenter

  @actor s1 student
  @actor s2 student
  @actor s3 student
  @actor s4 student

  "Hey psst, want to play a game?" A group of students beckon you over to a circle of chairs. "It's just spin the bottle, nothing weird."

  @next "placeholder" -> @exit